    </p>

    <div class="sec-eyebrow" style="margin-top:26px;">FLOW</div>
    <h2 style="margin-bottom:8px;">全体の構成の流れ</h2>
    <div class="flow">
      <div class="step">① 動機</div><div class="arrow">→</div>
